This project is a derivative of the Uplink 1.31 source code released on the
Uplink Developer CD, and is distributed under the Uplink Developers License
that came with that CD. Introversion Software has given the author written
permission to publish this source code, and to distribute free Windows, Linux
and macOS builds that require an installed copy of Uplink, under that license.

No Uplink game data is included. You need your own copy of Uplink to run it.

